DESCRIPTION:Learn at your own pace in a relaxed\, supportive setting. Brin
 g your own device\, or we can provide laptops. Practice your typing skills
  or how to use a mouse.\nMonday August 10 2pm-3pm\nMonday August 24 2pm 
 – 3pm\nMonday August 31 2pm-3pm
LOCATION:Amesbury Park\, Program Room
