BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:How To Volunteer To Build Skills And Gain Experience
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261029T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261029T193000
UID:6a3938a1ba0ec7dc2261cd76@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us in this free information session and discover how to s
 afely get involved as a volunteer to gain skills and build your resume. In
  this session you will:\nLearn how to start your formal volunteering.\nUnd
 erstand how to use Volunteer Toronto's website to search for opportunities
  that best match your interests and skills.\nSet expectations for what to 
 expect after you apply for a volunteer role.\nDiscuss how to use volunteer
 ing to build your resume and gain skills.\nThis session is great for anyon
 e who wants to make a positive impact on our city or learn new skills.\nPr
 esented by\nVolunteer Toronto\n.
LOCATION:Weston\, Program Room\, Basement Level
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a3938a1ba0ec7dc2261cd76
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
