 s will learn each component ingredient\, how to properly use a knife to ch
 op and slice\, and create their own sauce.\nDuring this hands-on\, one-hou
 r workshop\, Chef Sang will demonstrate how to make nutritious rice bowls\
 , based on Asian traditions. Each participant will construct an entire ric
 e bowl with a variety of seasoned vegetables\, cooked egg\, and spicy-swee
 t-vinegary sauce.  Cooked ingredients will be prepared in advance. Partici
 pants have the option of not using the egg and keeping it strictly vegetar
 ian.\nThis program is for Young adults 18 to 24\n(*contains egg\, sesame o
 il\, sesame seed)
