DESCRIPTION:This program provides a supportive\, low-pressure environment 
 where newcomers can build confidence in their English writing\, communicat
 ion\, and presentation skills. Together\, we will:\n1. Have a short\, coll
 ective discussion period.\n2. Begin writing based on a prompt from the ins
 tructor\n(Example: This year\, I learned... Last week\, I did... Something
  funny happened when…)\n3. Present what we wrote to the group.\nPlease n
 ote: This is a group meeting. We do not offer individual lessons. We will 
 not be spell-checking\, looking at punctuation\, grammar\, ect. We will be
  focusing on basic sentence structure and presentation.
