UID:6a3adcaa7e16a03d00e788b9@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In celebration of Emancipation Month\, join us to explore Ambu
 nu\, a traditional African botanical used for gentle hair cleansing and co
 nditioning. This interactive workshop highlights the rich history of herba
 l hair care practices and the benefits of plant-based ingredients for scal
 p and hair wellness.\nParticipants will learn about the science of natural
  hair care\, including how different oils support scalp health and hydrati
 on. The session features a guided\, hands-on activity where you’ll perso
 nalize a prepared Ambunu treatment using essential oils\, while also learn
 ing about the full herbal preparation and formulation process.\nInformatio
 n Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected b
