 ce.\nThe tour will start and end at the Thorncliffe branch\, program room
  and will be guided by the City of Toronto Urban Forestry staff. There ma
 y be uneven\, unpaved surfaces along the route. Please dress and prepare a
 ccordingly for this outdoor program (e.g. gloves/mittens\, hats\, sunscree
